  "mou": {
    "updatedTimestamp": "2021-09-17T17:33:46.086158Z",
    "mouTemplate": "<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><b><span style='font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;</span></b><span\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><b><span style='font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;</span></b><span\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><b><span style='font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>I.&nbsp;<u>INTRODUCTION</u></span></b><span\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>THIS MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING\r\n(\u201cMemorandum\u201d), executed on this date&nbsp;between&nbsp;<b>HENRY COUNTY</b>; hereafter referred to as \u201cCOUNTY\u201d and you and your\r\nPARTNER organization with its principal address indicated within the Registry\r\nportal, hereafter referred to as \u201cPARTNER\u201d; collectively referred to as \u201cTHE PARTNERS.\u201d<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><b><span style='font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>II.<u>&nbsp;PREAMBLES</u></span></b><span\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>WHEREAS, COUNTY is a law\r\nenforcement organization responsible for the preservation of safety and\r\nsecurity&nbsp;in the geographic area in which the County has jurisdiction.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>WHEREAS, Partner is a resident or\r\norganization operating within the jurisdiction of&nbsp;County.\u200b<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>WHEREAS, this Agreement has as its\r\nobjective the collaboration and participation of both organizations for the\r\nsafety and security of those who are at Partner\u2019s location(s),&nbsp;&nbsp;and\r\nfor this reason this Agreement facilitates the establishment of channels of\r\ncommunication and sharing of video sources that permit the creation and\r\ninterchange of information, as well as collaboration with the expressed goal of\r\nproviding enhanced responsiveness and situational awareness for County on\r\nbehalf of Partner.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>WHEREAS, the missions of the Partners\r\nare complementary;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>THEREFORE, the Partners wish to work\r\ntogether and in compliance with the following clauses:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><b><span style='font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>III.&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>GOAL</u></span></b><span\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>The goal of this agreement is to set\r\nforth guidelines for sharing of Partner\u2019s video sources with the County.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-size:18.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;</span><span\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-size:18.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;</span><b><span\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>IV.&nbsp;<u>PURPOSE</u></span></b><span\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>Video access is granted by Partner\r\nto video sources designated by Partner that are owned by or under management by\r\nPartner.&nbsp;&nbsp;Cameras shared must also be approved by County as\r\nappropriate for sharing and deemed useful for purposes of enhanced situational\r\nawareness and safety of Partner and areas surrounding Partner\u2019s\r\nlocation(s).&nbsp;&nbsp;It is neither intended nor expected that Partner\u2019s\r\ncameras will be routinely monitored in real-time by County. Video sharing\r\nby Partner with County is intended to be done in the spirit of partnership\r\nfor improved situational awareness and efficiency of emergency response by\r\nCounty.&nbsp;&nbsp;Video access by County does not constitute\r\ncommitment on the part of County that video will be viewed in emergencies\r\nor when requested by Partner.&nbsp; &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><b><span lang=ES\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\nmso-ansi-language:ES'>&nbsp;</span></b><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><b><span style='font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>V.&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>RESPONSIBILITIES\r\nOF COUNTY</u></span></b><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>County will only access video\r\nsources designated by Partner for fusion into County\u2019s video fusion\r\nsoftware.&nbsp;&nbsp;County will not share access to Partner\u2019s camera views\r\nwith members of the public, or outside of County, without the prior written\r\nconsent of Partner.&nbsp;&nbsp;Further, County will ensure video access is\r\nstrictly limited to personnel responsible for monitoring the system, and\r\nauthorized login metadata will be tracked and logged.&nbsp;&nbsp;Finally,\r\nCounty will ensure any employee responsible for video access is trained on\r\nsystem use and security of access.&nbsp;&nbsp;The County will direct any\r\ninquiries related to Partner or Partner\u2019s video sources to the appropriate\r\ndesignee as indicated in Section VIII.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><b><span style='font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>VI.&nbsp;<u>RESPONSIBILITIES\r\nOF PARTNER</u></span></b><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>Partner will provide County at\r\nleast one point of contact, as indicated below, with a basic understanding of\r\nPartner\u2019s inventory and locations of surveillance cameras as may be required\r\nfor video sharing.&nbsp;&nbsp;Typical configuration should take less than an\r\nhour and may require installation of additional hardware at Partner\r\nlocation(s).&nbsp;&nbsp;Partner will provide information needed by the\r\nCounty for the system to operate; including but not limited to, camera\r\nmake, model, IP address, and Camera and/or associated DVR/NVR login\r\ninformation.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><b><span style='font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>VII.&nbsp;<u>LIMITATION\r\nOF LIABILITY</u></span></b><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>IN NO EVENT WILL EITHER PARTY BE\r\nLIABLE TO THE OTHER FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, EXEMPLARY, PUNITIVE\r\nOR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES OF ANY KIND, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO LOST\r\nREVENUES, PROFITS, OR GOODWILL, FOR ANY MATTER ARISING OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION\r\nWITH THE PERFORMANCE OR NONPERFORMANCE OF THIS AGREEMENT.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><b><span style='font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>VIII.&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>EFFECTIVE\r\nDATES AND AMENDMENTS.</u></span></b><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>This MOU shall take effect upon\r\nsigning by both Parties and shall remain in effect for a period of five (5)\r\nyears from that date unless earlier terminated.&nbsp;&nbsp;Neither party may\r\nassign or transfer all or any portion of this MOU without the prior written\r\nconsent of the other party.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>The MOU may be renewed at the end of\r\nthis period by mutual written agreement by both Parties.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>The provisions of this MOU may only\r\nbe amended or waived by mutual written agreement by both Parties.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>Any Party may terminate this MOU and\r\nany related agreement at any time and for any reason by giving written notice\r\nto the other Party.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>The individuals signing this MOU on\r\nbehalf of their respective entities represent and warrant (without personal\r\nliability therefor) that upon the signature of each, this MOU shall have been\r\nduly executed by the entity each represents.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><b><u><span style='font-family:\r\n\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>ENTIRETY</span></u></b><span\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>This Agreement, including all\r\nAnnexes, embodies the entire and complete understanding and agreement between\r\nthe Parties and no amendment will be effective unless signed by the both\r\nParties.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:9.0pt'><span style='font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"'>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>"
  },
